{
  "_comment": "Golden vectors for lib/quote/calculate.test.js, against rate card v1 (lib/quote/seed.js) built from docs/PRICING_PLAYBOOK.md. Changing a vector's expected output means the pricing changed \u2014 that should be a reviewed, deliberate edit, not a side effect of refactoring the engine.",
